          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4z"></path><path d="M9 4v16M4 9h5"></path></svg>每日25词 · 艾宾浩斯</h3>
            <p>按遗忘曲线复习：1天·2天·4天·7天·15天。今日新词+复习词：</p>
            <div id="wordList"><div style="padding:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:8px;text-align:center"><p style="color:var(--hint);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px">今日还没添加单词 · 点击"载入今日25词"自动推荐四级高频词</p><p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--hint)">词库共100+词，每日按日期循环推荐25词，含熟词生义+巧记+真题例句+有道标准发音</p></div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;align-items:center">
              <input id="newWordInput" placeholder="输入英文单词(自动校验拼写)" style="max-width:200px" onkeydown="if(event.key===&#39;Enter&#39;)addWord()">
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" onclick="addWord()">+ 添加今日新词</button>
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-teal" onclick="markWordDone()">标记今日完成</button>
              <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="loadPresetWords()">载入今日25词</button>
              <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="dictationMode()">开始听写</button>
            </div>
            <div id="dictationBox" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:8px">
              <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">听写模式 · 看释义拼单词</h4>
              <div id="dictationWord" style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px"></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:6px">
                <input id="dictationInput" placeholder="输入单词拼写..." onkeydown="if(event.key===&#39;Enter&#39;)checkDictation()">
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" onclick="checkDictation()">核对</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="playWordAudio()">听发音</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="nextDictation()">下一个</button>
              </div>
              <div id="dictationResult" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
      <div style="margin-top:16px"><div class="card">
            <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline></svg>高分作文模板 · 每日刷新</h3>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <span class="tag tag-teal" id="essayType">问题解决型 · 议论文 / 社会问题</span>
              <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--hint)">类型 · 适用题型</span>
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" onclick="nextEssayTpl()" style="margin-left:auto">换一篇 ↻</button>
              <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="toggleEssayHistory()">查看历史</button>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;background:var(--bg);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap" id="essayBody">Nowadays, [问题现象] has become a matter of great concern. It not only [危害一], but also [危害二].

To address this issue, several measures should be taken. First and foremost, [措施一]. Moreover, [措施二]. Last but not least, [措施三].

Only through the joint efforts of [主体] can we [升华]. As a college student, I will [个人行动].</p>
            <h4>高级句式储备</h4>
            <ul id="essaySentences"><li>危害：not only... but also...</li><li>措施：First / Moreover / Last but not least</li><li>升华：Only through... can we...</li></ul>
            <div class="callout callout-info" style="margin-top:8px"><strong>使用方法：</strong>每天一篇不同类型模板，先背结构再填内容；点"换一篇"可立即刷新；点"查看历史"可回顾最近30天看过的模板，便于复盘积累。</div>
            <div id="essayHistoryBox" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed var(--border);padding-top:12px">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom:8px">最近查看过的模板</h4>
              <div id="essayHistoryList" style="font-size:13px"></div>
            </div>
          </div></div>
    

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>错题本</h3>
          <p>记录做错的题，标注错因，定期复盘。错题不复盘=白做。</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px">
            <input id="wrongQType" placeholder="题型(听力/阅读/翻译)" style="max-width:140px">
            <input id="wrongQDesc" placeholder="错题描述与错因">
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="addWrong()">记录</button>
          </div>
          <div id="wrongList"><p style="color:var(--hint);font-size:13px">还没有错题记录</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg>英语精读 · CET4 真题风格文章</h3>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">词汇 / 译文 / 长难句 / 我的笔记 · 每天精读1篇胜过泛读10篇</p>
          <div id="readingContainer"><div style="margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--hint)">第 6 篇 / 共 6 篇 · 每日轮换 · 点"换一篇"切换</span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" onclick="nextReadingArticle()">换一篇</button></div><div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px"><h3>Passage 6 · 大学生与独立思考（难度 ★★★）</h3><h4>原文</h4><p style="line-height:2.0;color:var(--text);font-size:16px">University is not merely a place to acquire professional knowledge, but a training ground for independent thinking. In high school, students are often given standard answers, while in college, they are expected to question assumptions, evaluate evidence, and construct their own arguments. A student who merely memorizes textbooks will struggle in an era where information is instantly available online. The most valuable skill a graduate can carry away is the ability to learn how to learn—to update one's knowledge continuously and adapt to a rapidly changing world.</p><h4>重点词汇</h4><div style="margin-bottom:6px"><span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:2px 4px 2px 0;display:inline-block">merely adv.仅仅；只是</span><span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:2px 4px 2px 0;display:inline-block">assumption n.假设；假定</span><span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:2px 4px 2px 0;display:inline-block">evaluate v.评估；评价</span><span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:2px 4px 2px 0;display:inline-block">construct v.构建；建立</span><span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:2px 4px 2px 0;display:inline-block">adapt v.适应；调整</span></div><h4>中文译文</h4><p style="background:var(--bg);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;line-height:2.0;font-size:15px">大学不仅仅是获取专业知识的地方，更是独立思考的训练场。高中时学生常被给予标准答案，而大学里，他们被期望去质疑假设、评估证据、构建自己的论证。一个只会死记课本的学生，在信息随手可得的网络时代会举步维艰。毕业生能带走的最有价值的技能，是"学会如何学习"的能力——持续更新知识、适应快速变化的世界。</p><h4>长难句精析</h4><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;font-size:15px">长难句：The most valuable skill a graduate can carry away is the ability to learn how to learn—to update one's knowledge continuously and adapt to a rapidly changing world. 主干 The skill is the ability；a graduate can carry away 为省略 that 的定语从句修饰 skill；破折号后解释 ability。</p><h4>思考题</h4><div style="padding:6px 0;border-top:1px dashed var(--border);font-size:14px"><strong style="color:var(--primary)">Q：</strong> 大学最重要的能力是什么？<br><strong style="color:var(--teal)">A：</strong> 学会如何学习——持续更新知识、适应变化。</div><h4>我的笔记</h4><textarea id="rn_5_Passage " placeholder="写下你的理解、生词、仿写句...（自动保存）" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8" onblur="saveReadingNoteKey(&#39;5_Passage &#39;,this.value)"></textarea><button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="saveReadingNoteKey(&#39;5_Passage &#39;,document.getElementById(&#39;rn_5_Passage &#39;).value)">保存笔记</button><span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);margin-left:10px" id="rnSaved_5_Passage "></span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-pane" id="t-cet6">
        <div class="callout callout-info">
          <strong>六级定位：</strong>过四级即可报六级，建议大一/大二趁热打铁考掉。六级550+是保研/求职强加分项，越早过越主动。
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-bottom:16px">
          <div class="metric"><div class="label">目标分数</div><div class="value"><input type="text" id="cet6GoalInput" placeholder="" style="border:none;background:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-weight:inherit;color:inherit;width:80px;text-align:center;outline:none;border-bottom:2px solid var(--primary)"></div><div class="sub" contenteditable="true" data-key="cet6-exam-label" style="cursor:text">考试时间（如：6月）</div></div>
