          <div class="metric"><div class="label">每日单词</div><div class="value" id="cet6WordProgress">0/40</div><div class="sub">六级词汇量6000+</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-2">
          <div class="card">
            <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"></path><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path></svg>六级报名入口</h3>
