          <div class="card">
            <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg>六级听力精听四步法</h3>
            <ol style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;padding-left:18px">
              <li><strong>预听：</strong>先读题干划关键词，预测话题与问题类型（长对话/讲座/新闻）</li>
              <li><strong>精听：</strong>逐句暂停跟读，划出连读、弱读、数字与转折词（but/however后常是考点）</li>
              <li><strong>对照：</strong>对照原文标出听错点，把生词按"听力词汇"记入单词本</li>
              <li><strong>复听：</strong>第二天盲听同一篇，直到100%听懂为止</li>
            </ol>
            <a class="res-link" href="https://m.kekenet.com/course/885" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="margin-top:10px">
              <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8"></polygon></svg></div>
              <div class="info"><div class="name">可可英语 · 六级听力真题</div><div class="desc">历年MP3+字幕，免费、无需登录，配合四步法精听</div></div><div class="arrow">↗</div>
            </a>
            <div class="callout callout-info" style="margin-top:8px"><strong>避坑：</strong>听力别只"听"不"写"——边听边记关键词，训练手耳同步；听不懂的句子当天解决，攒着会变成"听力盲区"。</div>
          </div>
          
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
